{"contract":"translation_contextual_v2","candidate_identity":"11d93395dc7248cf43bfdfea997efea9db5762a0e8e4caefaafb022bb278a613","verdicts":[{"revision_key":"fe5a84a1b4161500b909f7c7cccf4ff56e0c0f33c004784dbe94c0364943c4d4","verdict":"ISSUE","observation":"完整性：源文「Engulfs your hands (and weapons) in a sheath of fire」明确说明武器也会被火焰包覆（enhancement.lua:105 @624a673），译文只写「你的双手笼罩在火焰中」，漏了「（和武器）」。玩家可能因此误以为持武器攻击时没有这项附加火焰伤害。"},{"revision_key":"fe6310c9f8a1a5d1f2bd9098851b31fc90ee85c9223f7874b727921737412a9e","verdict":"OK"},{"revision_key":"fe90619ef2e1e48cab53d9352846971ad10ff1dfb3bbff4bfc27a5f58bea47f6","verdict":"ISSUE","observation":"机制遗漏：源文第 3 行「burn both of you for %0.2f fire damage (demons are healed instead) each turn」（shadowflame.lua:372 @624a673）写明是每回合伤害。译文「永恒之焰会燃烧你和目标，造成 %0.2f 火焰伤害」删掉了「每回合」，读起来像一次性伤害。另外 constant aura 被译成「永恒之焰」，没有表达出「持续光环」的意思。"},{"revision_key":"feba8a653c48d907381a69ae33c445ee31aa1a8d8f55fc666debaa6f5a4a7e28","verdict":"OK"},{"revision_key":"fec0939b43c92583f4d00aeb244393a5348b9d4d9d20be01e6b3cb39ceaa0d35","verdict":"OK"},{"revision_key":"fec33d861518d5ce6e2040cf74aadeafe7dc3850b4facc8d66b886ea4780c648","verdict":"OK"},{"revision_key":"fede357f5d4fef66dfe5b57df64d0e8f188542309b3b05f8e0c2dd8114afcae9","verdict":"OK"},{"revision_key":"ff084e54304a7fde58908b7939a7bbbb5b5612d9236bb7cf46e1f2d6382c7fdc","verdict":"OK"},{"revision_key":"ff47fb8608636c14b4edd992f2f91eb3cfefc2eeab07857e8bc51adbffa7457b","verdict":"ISSUE","observation":"语义失真：源文是「Regeneration infusions act over several turns, letting you anticipate damage that will be taken and prepare for it.」（init.lua:110 @624a673），意思是持续回复可以用来预判并提前应对即将受到的伤害。译文把后半句换成了自拟内容「开启后每回合会恢复一定的生命值，使你的战斗更加从容不迫」：「开启后」暗示这是可开关的技能，但纹身是一次性使用的物品；「预判伤害并提前准备」这层意思也丢了。"},{"revision_key":"ff585d0b17d2092a15ee66c669828233c547008396dfa8f6e1aa4adefd8af6a7","verdict":"OK"},{"revision_key":"ff658fab2952efff6ddacb8a31c9598d2d5337642bdd2fa7d640b496bf77f6ee","verdict":"ISSUE","observation":"语义错误：wispy 意为「轻薄缥缈、如烟似缕」。这件神器是 Ethereal Embrace，描述为「waves and bends with shimmering light」（world-artifacts.lua:6403-6405 @624a673），应表达缥缈、轻纱般的质感。译文「脆弱的紫色斗篷」凭空加上了「易碎、不结实」的属性，与原意和物品设定不符。"}]}